---
import Section from './Section.astro';
---

<Section title="Professional" id="professional">
  <div class="prose">
    <p>
      I'm an AI-first full-stack engineer with over four years of commercial experience, built on
      a decade in IT service management and leadership. That gives me a rare combination of
      hands-on engineering and deep commercial understanding, having spent years working closely
      with business processes and stakeholders before moving into product development.
    </p>
    <p>
      I operate at the intersection of product, design, and code, building web applications
      end-to-end. Modern AI tooling, including Cursor and LLM-assisted TDD, helps me move quickly
      without compromising quality, but the user always comes first. I enjoy taking ideas from
      early ambiguity through to shipped features that deliver real business value.
    </p>
    <p>
      My background shapes how I build: I prioritise clarity, reliability, and maintainability,
      and I take full ownership from discovery to production. Recently I've focused on
      Vue/TypeScript frontends and Python/Django backends, with a growing interest in prototyping
      and iterating on AI-powered user experiences.
    </p>
    <p>
      My experience in software spans the public sector, health services, and legal tech.
    </p>
  </div>
</Section>

<style>
  :global(#professional) {
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, var(--bg) 0%, rgba(30, 42, 58, 0.25) 100%);
  }
</style>
